{"id":"624994","name":"白蒿鸡蛋煎饼","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/624994/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白蒿","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"拽的白蒿，备用。","img":"images/624994/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"白蒿择净，只要叶子和茎干部分，去除根和黄叶，淘洗干净，控干水分。","img":"images/624994/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切碎。","img":"images/624994/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盆中放入白蒿、鸡蛋、少许面粉和盐。","img":"images/624994/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加少许水，顺时针搅拌均匀成稀糊状。","img":"images/624994/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"平底锅烧热放少许油，倒入面糊摊匀。","img":"images/624994/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小火慢煎，翻面，煎至两面金黄色即可。","img":"images/624994/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"OK","img":"images/624994/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切片装盘，营养丰富，好吃。","img":"images/624994/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}